      "message": "Since it doesn\u0027t use the CrosEC flash layout it\u0027s not initialized and this generates errors. I suspect we could just replace the guard with this:\n\n    #if defined(CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_RW_TOTAL_IMAGE_SIZE)\n\nWe\u0027d end up with the same protections that this was trying to do in a way that is more directly identifies the problem:\n\n    #if defined(CONFIG_CPU_CORTEX_M) || defined(CONFIG_CPU_CORTEX_R) || \\\n        defined(CONFIG_CPU_CORTEX_A) || defined (CONFIG_RISCV)",
      "parentUuid": "985b166e_1ca44c0b",
